" la vista scrive sulla sorgente::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/indexing-and-slicing.rst:50
msgid ""
"When an independent buffer is needed, :meth:`~numpy.ndarray.copy` produces "
"one explicitly."
msgstr ""
"Quando serve un buffer indipendente, :meth:`~numpy.ndarray.copy` ne produce "
"uno esplicitamente."

